   "source": [
    "# Step 3 — Data cleaning and feature identification\n",
    "\n",
    "The initial audit found no missing values, exact duplicate rows, repeated `Campaign_ID` values, category-label inconsistencies, or impossible values. Therefore, cleaning must preserve all observations. The code below creates a deep copy, documents the decision for every potential cleaning action, and repeats the quality checks before modelling.\n",
    "\n",
    "No observation is removed or altered without a documented reason."
   ]
  },
